            "script": "\t# Always open on a blank review panel. Anything on file belongs to an\n\t# earlier run, so it is archived rather than shown -- nothing is deleted,\n\t# and a proposal the agent saves from here on appears normally.\n\ttry:\n\t\texchange.tagImport.core.archiveLatestProposal()\n\texcept Exception, e:\n\t\t# Never block the page on this. Worst case it opens showing the last\n\t\t# proposal, which is what it did before.\n\t\tsystem.util.getLogger(\u0027exchange.tagImport.Page\u0027).warn(\n\t\t\t\u0027Could not clear the previous proposal: %s\u0027 % str(e))\n"
          },
          "scope": "G",
          "type": "script"
        }
